{"words": [{"text": "إِن", "translation": "If"}, {"text": "تَجْتَنِبُوا۟", "translation": "you avoid"}, {"text": "كَبَآئِرَ", "translation": "great (sins)"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "(of) what"}, {"text": "تُنْهَوْنَ", "translation": "you are forbidden"}, {"text": "عَنْهُ", "translation": "from [it]"}, {"text": "نُكَفِّرْ", "translation": "We will remove"}, {"text": "عَنكُمْ", "translation": "from you"}, {"text": "سَيِّـَٔاتِكُمْ", "translation": "your evil deeds"}, {"text": "وَنُدْخِلْكُم", "translation": "and We will admit you"}, {"text": "مُّدْخَلًۭا", "translation": "(to) an entrance"}, {"text": "كَرِيمًۭا", "translation": "noble"}], "sahih": "If you avoid the major sins which you are forbidden, We will remove from you your lesser sins and admit you to a noble entrance [into Paradise]."}